{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slide":3,"text":"这一页播放录屏时，按这条路径走：选择 Stablecoin Pre-listing；输入 Singapore、EEA、USDC、Base/Ethereum、listing 和 custody；运行后先展示 capability-level 的两个 CONDITIONAL 结论，再点开 action 和 evidence。最后指出 Article 59、dossier、corpus/rules/template 版本和 PROVISIONAL 标签。核心句：RAG 帮助解释证据，但不能改变 deterministic decision。若要嵌入视频，可把整块浏览器视窗替换为 MP4，保留标题和右上角标签。\n\n[Sources]\n- contracts/fixtures/citely/v1/stablecoin-pre-listing-success.request.json\n- contracts/fixtures/citely/v1/stablecoin-pre-listing-success.response.json\n- docs/citely-integration.md"}
